 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## smallpt (WebAssembly)
+
+The home page includes a live render from [smallpt](http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/), compiled to WebAssembly. The source is in `wasm/smallpt.cpp`. It is the original code with `main()` replaced by exported functions for progressive rendering and for setting sphere colors. The compiled output in `public/smallpt/` is checked in. To rebuild it you need [Emscripten](https://emscripten.org/):
+
+```sh
+pnpm run build:wasm
+```
